   "description": "<p>Elevation Recruitment Group is partnering with an established, growing Doncaster business that is embracing AI. Colleagues across the company are already using tools like Claude and Copilot to build their own applications. Now they want an experienced engineer to make sure that energy is channelled safely, and to build the framework that lets it flourish.</p><p><br></p><p>This is a newly created role with real influence. You'll own how AI-assisted software is built, reviewed and released: setting the standards, peer reviewing what's been built, taking applications into production and coaching colleagues along the way. You'll sit alongside the Automation Team, work closely with the Web Developer and report to the Head of IT. The function is expected to grow into a team, with the chance to lead it in time.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>What you'll be doing</strong></p><ul><li>Creating and owning the framework, policies and documentation for AI-assisted application development</li><li>Peer reviewing AI-generated code for security, quality and long-term supportability, and refactoring where needed</li></ul>",
