   "description": "<p><strong>C# Developer, Azure, SQL/Postgres, Remote, COR7721</strong></p><p>Are you a C# developer with strong database experience looking for your next challenge? Then this role, working at a cutting-edge company on exciting and innovative projects, could be the opportunity for you!</p><p><strong>The Role<br></strong>The C# Developer will be joining a technical startup company. They’ll use strong C# skills, solid SQL/Postgres database experience and experience deploying in Azure to work with a small, agile team on cutting-edge applications. A key part of the role will be designing, optimising and maintaining the databases that sit behind the product.</p><p><strong>The Company<br></strong>Our client is an emerging, well-financed startup with a track record of rapid growth. Working with cutting-edge technology, this role offers the chance to work on a product that already has a customer base.<br>This is a remote role, with monthly team meet-ups in Oxford.</p><p><strong>What’s Required?</strong><br>For this C# Developer position, the main things we’re looking for are a curious mind, willingness to learn, and a desire to pick up new technologies. Ideally we’re looking for:</p><ul><li><p>Strong understanding of computer science and software development principles</p></li><li><p>Coding experience with C#, ideally including microservice development</p></li><li><p>Experience with SQL and relational databases, ideally Postgres, including schema design, query writing and performance tuning</p></li><li><p>Strong experience with Azure, with knowledge of deploying web apps and services in Azure</p></li><li><p>Experience writing applications that use service/message bus style technologies</p></li></ul><p><strong>What Next?</strong><br>If you’re a C# Developer with strong SQL/Postgres skills looking for a challenging new role with a great technical company, please apply today to learn more!</p><p><strong>C# Software Developer, SQL, Postgres, Azure, Remote, COR7721</strong><br>Corriculo Ltd acts as an employment agency and an employment business. #indhigh</p>",
   "sponsorship": "not mentioned",
