   "skills": [],
   "description": "<p><strong>C# .NET Software Engineer | Azure | AI | Hybrid, London</strong></p><p> £60,000 to £70,000 + Equity + Benefits</p><p><strong>Most engineers will spend the AI boom plugging into someone else’s product. You could be building one of the platforms the boom runs on.</strong></p><p>AI is moving out of demos and into the work big organisations really depend on, and the bar is high. Our client is a well-funded AI start-up building the platform that lets companies trust AI with their hardest, highest-stakes problems. The team is small, the ambition is huge, and the backend is up for grabs.</p><p><strong>Why this one is different</strong></p><p> This isn’t a job where you spend two years fixing tickets in a corner of a giant codebase. You’ll be one of the first backend engineers, so the architecture you design this year is what the company grows on. Your name will be on large parts of the product.</p><p><strong>What you’ll be doing</strong></p><ul><li>Building the engine: backend services and microservices in C#, .NET and ASP.NET Core that keep the whole platform running</li><li>Going cloud-native at scale on Microsoft Azure, designing systems built to grow ten times over</li><li>Putting LLMs to work, wiring the latest AI models into real production workflows rather than toy projects</li><li>Building the APIs and data services that turn messy, complex data into something useful</li><li>Chasing every millisecond: profiling, tuning and making the system fast</li><li>Shaping the tech from day one. Bring your opinions, because they’ll be heard</li></ul><p><strong>Who we’re looking for</strong></p><ul><li>1 to 3 years building things in C# .NET, or a standout graduate with serious C# projects to show</li><li>Someone who cares about clean code and knows their data structures</li><li>Excited by the cloud, Azure and microservices, even if you haven’t mastered them yet</li><li>Fascinated by AI and LLMs (no machine learning background needed, just curiosity)</li><li>A great communicator who wants to be in the room where decisions are made</li><li>A degree in Computer Science, Maths, Physics, Engineering or another STEM subject</li></ul><p>Bonus points for SQL or NoSQL, REST APIs, Docker, CI/CD or Python.</p><p><strong>What’s in it for you</strong></p><ul><li>£60,000 to £70,000 base salary</li><li>Real equity, so when the company wins, you win</li><li>Hybrid working from a Central London office</li><li>A fast track: as the team grows, the people who built it lead it</li><li>Hard problems, smart people, and work that matters</li></ul><p>Interviews are happening now. Apply today with your CV and a consultant will be in touch within 48 hours if suited.</p><p><em>Keywords: C#, .NET, .NET Core, .NET 8, ASP.NET Core, Azure, Software Engineer, Software Developer, Backend Developer, Backend Engineer, Junior C# Developer, Graduate Software Engineer, AI, LLM, Microservices, REST API, Cloud, London, Hybrid</em></p><p><br></p>",
