   "description": "<p>Our client is in the Travel & Logistics Sector and is looking to grow their team with a new C# Developer. This role will be 3 days a week in the Woking office the rest at home. You will be working on mainly Greenfield projects with a strong focus on AI, C# and Azure in a team of 5 developers and a Solution Architect.</p><p><strong>Client Details</strong></p><p>Our client is in the Travel & Logistics Sector and is looking to grow their team with a new C# Developer. This role will be 3 days a week in the Woking office the rest at home. You will be working on mainly Greenfield projects with a strong focus on AI, C# and Azure in a team of 5 developers and a Solution Architect.</p><p><strong>Description</strong></p><p>This is an AI first team (Claude) and around 60% of your time will be spent on C# solutions and the rest focused on Azure DevOps</p><ul><li>Develop and maintain C# applications to support business operations.</li><li>Govern the teams Azure DevOps pipelines</li><li>Approve or reject pipeline deployments</li><li>Monitor deployed Azure workload infrastructure</li><li>Collaborate with the technology team to design and implement software solutions.</li><li>Debug, test, and optimise code to ensure high performance and reliability.</li><li>Provide technical support and troubleshooting for existing systems.</li><li>Contribute to code reviews and ensure adherence to best practices.</li><li>Work with stakeholders to gather and understand requirements.</li><li>Maintain up-to-date documentation for software and processes.</li><li>Stay informed about new technologies and propose improvements where suitable.</li></ul><p><strong>Profile</strong></p><p>Must haves:</p><ul><li>C#</li><li>Experience governing, building, and troubleshooting Azure DevOps pipelines</li><li>Azure Service Bus, Logic Apps, Functions Apps, App Services, SQL databases, App Gateways, APIM</li><li>Bicep or Terraform</li><li>Strong SQL</li><li>Strong communication / collaboration skills</li><li>Interest / experience in AI - Claude code or similar</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Job Offer</strong></p><ul><li>28 days + BHS</li><li>Pension 5% from employer</li><li>Private medical</li><li>Dental cover</li><li>Life assurance 3 x salary</li><li>EAP </li><li>13% bonus</li></ul>",
