   "description": "<strong>Senior Software Engineer (Java, .NET, Python)</strong><ul><li><p><strong>Location:</strong> Fully Remote</p></li><li><p><strong>Salary:</strong> £50,000 - £85,000 (dependent on experience)</p></li></ul><p>We are looking for a number Senior Software Engineers / Lead Engineers who arent boxed into a single stack. If you are a Polygot / T-Shaped engineer with deep expertise in one core area alongside the flexibility to pick up whatever language, framework, or cloud tool the project demand this role is for you.</p><p>We need people who care about solving complex client challenges with adaptable, scalable, and resilient software solutions.</p><strong>What You'll Do:</strong><ul><li><p><strong>Drive Architecture & Delivery:</strong> Design, build, and scale complex, robust software solutions aligned with business goals.</p></li><li><p><strong>Be a True Polyglot:</strong> Seamlessly pivot across modern stacks when project needs shift.</p></li><li><p><strong>Mentor & Elevate:</strong> Guide junior engineers and champion coding best practices, automated testing, and code reviews.</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaborate Cross-Functionally:</strong> Work hand-in-hand with product management, UX/UI, DevOps, and QA to deliver impact.</p></li><li><p><strong>Optimise & Automate:</strong> Build and streamline CI/CD pipelines and infrastructure-as-code deployments.</p></li></ul><strong>Skills: </strong><ul><li><p><strong>T-Shaped / Polyglot Mindset:</strong> Deep experience in at least one core stack (<strong>Java/Kotlin</strong>, <strong>Python</strong>, <strong>C#/.NET</strong>, or <strong>Full-Stack JavaScript</strong> including Express, React, and Node.js), paired with the adaptability to learn new technologies rapidly.</p></li><li><p><strong>Engineering Excellence:</strong> Extensive full-stack experience encompassing system design, testing, and deployment.</p></li><li><p><strong>Modern Cloud & DevOps:</strong> Familiarity with cloud platforms (<strong>AWS</strong>, <strong>Azure</strong>, <strong>GCP</strong>), Infrastructure as Code (<strong>Terraform</strong>), containerisation (<strong>Docker</strong>, <strong>Kubernetes</strong>), and microservices.</p></li><li><p><strong>Agile & Quality-Focused:</strong> Strong advocacy for TDD, clean code, and continuous improvement.</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p>Send your CV for more details. </p><p><strong>Reasonable Adjustments:</strong></p><p>Respect and equality are core values to us. We are proud of the diverse and inclusive community we have built, and we welcome applications from people of all backgrounds and perspectives. Our success is driven by our people, united by the spirit of partnership to deliver the best resourcing solutions for our clients.</p><p><strong><em>If you need any help or adjustments during the recruitment process for any reason</em></strong><strong><em>, </em></strong><strong><em>please let us know when you apply or talk to the recruiters directly so we can support you.</em></strong></p>",
