   "description": "<p>We are looking for an experienced C# developer to develop new software products, and modifications to existing</p><p>products.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong></p><ul><li>Carry out designated programming work to agreed timescales and standards</li><li>Develop modifications and bug fixes for software products, as necessary</li><li>Administer databases, as applicable</li><li>Provide client support/consultancy when necessary</li><li>Act as back up to Technical Support</li><li>Provide input to technical manuals and other documentation</li><li>To complete other relevant tasks as reasonably assigned</li></ul><p><strong>Essential:</strong></p><ul><li>C# RESTful</li><li>JavaScript</li><li>MS SQ</li><li>Back-end development</li><li>A proven track record in a similar role</li><li>Good written and verbal communication skills</li></ul><p><strong>Desirable:</strong></p><ul><li>Financial Services knowledge</li><li>Client facing</li><li>React js</li><li>HTML, CSS</li><li>Professional studies in languages and operating environments</li></ul><p>This is a Hybrid role with 2/3 days in the office</p>",
