   "description": "<p>Are you interested in joining our excellent team to maintain our high standards of holistic care to acute, weaning and chronic respiratory patients? Do you have the skills we are looking for to ensure we get it right for every patient, every time?</p> <p>Ward 23 is looking to recruit motivated Healthcare Assistants in a permanent position. We are a 33 bedded ward who provide support to patients who have respiratory diseases including chronic obstructive pulmonary disease, asthma, pleural effusions, bronchiectasis and many other respiratory diseases.</p> <p>We are looking for the committed, compassionate and caring people that want to make a positive difference to peoples lives</p> <p><strong>**Please note this vacancy will close once sufficient applications have been received.**</strong></p> <p></p> <strong>Please note that we are unable to offer a Certificate of Sponsorship (CoS) for this role.</strong> <p><strong></strong></p></p> <h4>Main duties of the job</h4> <p><p><strong>Healthcare Assistant - Ward 23</strong></p> <p><strong>Permanent</strong></p> <p>Are you interested in joining our excellent team to maintain our high standards of holistic care to acute, weaning and chronic respiratory patients? Do you have the skills we are looking for to ensure we get it right for every patient, every time?</p> <p>Ward 23 is looking to recruit motivated Healthcare Assistants in a permanent position. We are a 33 bedded ward who provide support to patients who have respiratory diseases including chronic obstructive pulmonary disease, asthma, pleural effusions, bronchiectasis and many other respiratory diseases. We are currently the covid ward at present</p> <p>We are looking for the committed, compassionate and caring people that want to make a positive difference to peoples lives</p> <p></p> <p></p> <p></p> <p></p> <p><strong>**Please be advised that this post will close once sufficient applications have been received, so please apply soon if interested**</strong></p></p> <h4>About us</h4> <p><p>Liverpool University Hospitals NHS Foundation Trust comprises Aintree University Hospital, Broadgreen Hospital &amp; Royal Liverpool University Hospital.</p> <p></p> <p>We are part of NHS University Hospitals of Liverpool Group, formed on 1 Nov 2024 from the coming together of LUHFT and Liverpool Women's NHS Foundation Trust. The Group was born from a shared aim to improve the care we provide our patients.</p> <p></p><p><i>Shortened here. The full description is on the original advert.</i></p>",
