   "description": "<p><strong>Domiciliary Care Worker – SandwellPay:</strong> £12.82 per hour</p><p><strong>Hours:</strong> AM Run (6:30am–2:00pm) | PM Run (4:30pm–10:00pm)</p><p><strong>Company:</strong> JLKare & Support Ltd – Family-run | CQC <em>Good</em> | <em>Outstanding Leadership</em></p><p><strong>About Us </strong>At <strong>JLKare & Support Ltd</strong>, we’re a family-run care company that believes great care starts with happy, valued staff. We’re proud to support people across Sandwell to live independently, safely, and with dignity in their own homes.</p><p><strong>The Role </strong>We’re looking for <strong>caring, reliable people</strong> to join our<strong> domiciliary care team in Sandwell</strong>. You’ll visit clients in the community to provide personal care, emotional support, and practical help — making a genuine difference to their daily lives.</p><ul><li><strong>Requirements - Driver with access to a car</strong> (mileage paid)</li><li>Must be able to work <strong>both AM and PM runs</strong></li><li>Compassionate, trustworthy, and good at communicating</li><li>No experience necessary — <strong>full paid training provided</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Why Work With JLKare? </strong>£12.21 per hour (leading local rate)</p><p>Paid induction & funded <strong>RQF Level 2/3 in Health & Social Care</strong></p><p><strong>Birthday off</strong> every year</p><p><strong>Monthly rotas</strong> for consistency and work-life balance</p><p><strong>Bonuses</strong>, “Employee of the Month,” and regular pay reviews</p><p>Supportive management – our Directors work alongside staff</p><p><strong>Staff pension scheme & uniform provided</strong></p><p><strong>Our Promise </strong>At JLKare, you’re not just a number. We know every team member by name and value your voice. We listen, we support, and we help you grow.</p><p><strong>Please note:</strong> This role is open to <strong>UK-based applicants only</strong>. You must already have the <strong>Right to Work in the UK</strong> (we are <strong>not able to offer visa sponsorship</strong>).</p><p><strong>Apply now</strong> to join our Sandwell team and be part of a company that truly cares about its people — both staff and clients.</p>",
