   "description": "<p><strong>About Us</strong></p><p>At JLKare, we’re a friendly, family-run care company that truly values both our clients <strong>and</strong> our staff. We believe good care starts with happy, supported workers — and we’re proud of our warm, inclusive culture where everyone feels part of the team.</p><p><strong>The Role</strong></p><p>We’re looking for caring, reliable people to join our team supporting adults to live independently in their own homes. You’ll help with day-to-day living, offer companionship, and support individuals to achieve their personal goals.</p><p><strong>Typical duties include:</strong></p><ul><li>Supporting people with daily routines (shopping, cooking, activities, personal care)</li><li>Encouraging independence and confidence</li><li>Supporting emotional well-being and social interaction</li><li>Accurately recording notes and updates</li><li>Working closely with colleagues and professionals</li></ul><p><strong>Shifts Available</strong></p><p>We offer flexible shift options to suit a range of lifestyles:</p><ul><li><strong>Early:</strong> 07:30 – 14:45</li><li><strong>Late:</strong> 14:45 – 21:30</li><li><strong>Day:</strong> 09:00 – 15:00 / 10:00 – 15:00 / 15:00 – 20:00</li><li>Includes weekday and weekend shifts.</li></ul><p><strong>Benefits</strong></p><ul><li>£12.82 per hour with <strong>two annual pay reviews</strong></li><li><strong>Birthday off</strong> every year</li><li><strong>Employee of the Month</strong> and yearly performance bonuses</li><li><strong>Fully funded training & development</strong> (Care certificate, etc)</li><li><strong>Pension scheme</strong> and paid holidays</li><li>Supportive, friendly management team</li></ul><p><strong>Please Note</strong></p><p>This position is open only to UK-based applicants. You <strong>must already have the Right to Work in the UK</strong> (we are <strong>not</strong> offering visa sponsorship at this time).</p><p><strong>Apply Now</strong></p><p>If you’re compassionate, dependable, and want to build a rewarding career in care, apply today. Join a company that celebrates your hard work and helps you grow.</p>",
