   "skills": [],
   "description": "<p>Would you like to develop your clinical skills while supporting patients to access high-quality sexual health services? We are seeking a motivated and caring Health Care Assistant to join our Somerset Wide Integrated Sexual Health (SWISH) team.</p><p>This is an exciting opportunity to become part of a specialist service delivering compassionate, confidential and inclusive care. Working alongside experienced nurses and doctors, you will support a range of clinical activities, contribute to patient care and develop specialist skills through training and ongoing professional development.</p></p> <h4>Main duties of the job</h4> <p><p>Working under the guidance of qualified clinicians, you will support the delivery of sexual health clinics across Somerset. Duties include providing direct patient support, acting as a chaperone during examinations, undertaking delegated clinical tasks, maintaining clinic stock and equipment, and completing associated administrative duties. You will also have opportunities to develop specialist skills, including microscopy, vaccination support and delivering aspects of asymptomatic screening services following training and competency assessment..</p><p>Your supporting statement is an important part of your application -- this is your opportunity to tell us why this particular role interests you and what makes you a great fit for the team. We'd like to hear about the skills, experience and personal qualities you can bring, including any transferable skills that would help you succeed in the post, even if you don't yet meet every part of the person specification.</p><p>If you'd like to find out more about the service or team prior to application, we always welcome informal conversations and visits prior to application. Please feel free to contact us on xxx</p></p> <h4>About us</h4> <p><p>At <strong>Somerset NHS Foundation Trust</strong>, we're committed to supporting our employees with a range of benefits designed to enhance your professional and personal life. We offer:</p><ul><li><strong>Flexible working options</strong> to help you balance work and life</li><li><strong>NHS pension scheme</strong> for long-term financial security</li><li><strong>Generous annual leave allowance</strong> to recharge and relax</li><li>A strong focus on <strong>career development</strong> to help you grow and achieve your potential</li></ul><p><i>Shortened here. The full description is on the original advert.</i></p>",
