   "description": "<p>Are you a caring and compassionate HealthCare Support Worker looking to work in an outstanding rated Trust? Beech ward, based at Yeatman Hospital, Sherborne is looking for either for someone who has experience or new to care (training is available) to join our supportive team.</p> <p>As a HealthCare Support Worker you will be working alongside a multi-disciplinary team, in a 12 bedded ward who provide sub-acute medical care, rehabilitation, Palliative / End of Life care for the local and wider community. Our Elderly Rehabilitation and End of Life Care unit achieved a nationally recognised accreditation in the Gold Standard Framework award for end-of-life care. Our team are a close-knit community, and we pride ourselves on always going the extra mile.</p> <p>We offer training and great opportunities for continuing development with a comprehensive and structured induction programme and training.</p> <p>The post is a full time/part-time role, we would be flexible and accept part time applications with a minimum of 12 hours. Shifts below</p> <p>Long days 0730-2030</p> <p>Weekend and public holidays at enhanced pay!</p> <p><strong>Please note visa sponsorship for this role is unfortunately not available. Ensure you hold valid right to work in the UK and will not require sponsorship if successful.</strong></p> <p></p></p> <h4>Main duties of the job</h4> <p><p>We are committed to providing excellent standards of care for our patients and we know that to enable us to do this, the continuous professional development of staff in a supportive environment has to be a top priority for us and it is!</p> <p>You will need enthusiasm and a commitment to provide the highest standards of care to patients, relative and carers, and the ability to provide professional clinical leadership. You will need to have an interest in working with older people and have good communication and organisational skills.</p> <p>In return we can also offer you:</p> <p>Pay enhancements for night, weekend and bank holiday working</p> <p>NHS pension scheme</p> <p>Holiday pay of up to 33 days, plus bank holidays pro rata, dependent on service</p> <p>NHS discount and salary sacrifice scheme</p> <p>Not forgetting our unique selling point - our Trust beach huts located along the famous Sandbanks coastline.</p> <p>Employment in this post requires an Enhanced Disclosure and Barring Service (DBS) check, which the Trust will cover the cost of.</p><p><i>Shortened here. The full description is on the original advert.</i></p>",
