   "description": "<p><strong>Support Worker - Chertsey</strong><br><strong>£25,845 per year (pro rata) / Full time 39 hours a week </strong></p> <p><strong>Having a full UK manual driving licence would be great for this role, as it really helps with getting out and about with the people we support</strong></p> <p>We're on the lookout for passionate and caring Support Workers with some experience to join our brilliant team at our 12-bed residential service in Chertsey. Right now, we've got 4 men and 8 women living with us, mostly needing 2 to 1 support, with some requiring 3 to 1. It's fair to say the support needs are pretty high here – there's manual handling involved, wheelchair users, and personal care support.</p> <p>Person Centred Active Support is at the heart of everything we do, and we're looking for like-minded support workers to join us in supporting young adults with:</p> <ul> <li>Autism / Learning disabilities</li><li>Physical disabilities</li><li>Dementia</li><li>Behaviours that challenge</li></ul> <p>No two days are the same, but you'll be:</p> <ul> <li>Supporting people to live independently and enjoy their everyday activities</li><li>Encouraging social connections with family, friends, and the local community</li><li>Helping out with finances, household tasks, and shopping</li><li>Providing respectful, person-centred personal care</li><li>Most importantly – creating those brilliant moments of joy and achievement!</li></ul> <p>At Avenues, we know that when our teams feel valued and supported, they create the best possible outcomes for the people we support. If you're looking for your next role in social care – we'd love to hear from you!</p> <p>What's in it for you?</p> <ul> <li>Early Pay – get your hands on your earnings before payday</li><li>Fully paid, enhanced DBS</li><li>Flexible working patterns</li><li>Paid annual leave (pro rata)</li><li>Loads of training and opportunities to progress your career</li><li>Contributory pension scheme with life assurance</li><li>Discounts on shopping, holidays, and loads more via Blue Light Card and our Benefits website</li><li>Recommend a Friend scheme – earn up to £500</li><li>24/7 health and wellbeing support, including confidential counselling</li></ul> <p><strong>Join Avenues – where people smile, laugh, grow, and achieve great things together.</strong></p> <p><strong>We celebrate diversity and welcome everyone!</strong></p><p><i>Shortened here. The full description is on the original advert.</i></p>",
